{
  "name": "tour",
  "title": "为整个工作流程腾出空间。",
  "summary": "设计、写作、评审、借用、自动化，再适应更大的桌面。",
  "requires": {
    "displays": 1
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "kind": "clearOverlay"
    },
    {
      "kind": "pointer",
      "display": 0,
      "x": 0.5,
      "y": 0.5
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Write",
      "profile": "Laptop"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Editor",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Design",
      "profile": "Laptop"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Canvas",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateApp",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cli",
      "args": [
        "layout",
        "balance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1800
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 设计"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "每个工作区分别保存一项任务所需的应用和窗口布局。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateApp",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt - return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "将一个窗口放大到整个工作区。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Canvas",
      "identifier": "canvas.sand"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "theme",
      "value": "sand"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Canvas",
      "identifier": "canvas.forest"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Canvas",
      "identifier": "canvas.sand"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "退出放大，恢复原来的窗口布局。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt - return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Docs",
      "identifier": "docs.content"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 写作"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "切换工作区，一起调出下一项任务需要的应用。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + shift - 1"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Write"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Editor",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Editor",
      "identifier": "editor.headline"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "cmd - a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "typeText",
      "app": "Editor",
      "text": "让工作更从容。",
      "ms": 65
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectValue",
      "app": "Editor",
      "identifier": "editor.headline",
      "value": "让工作更从容。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Editor",
      "identifier": "editor.save"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "headline",
      "value": "让工作更从容。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "回到 Design，之前的应用仍在原来的位置。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + shift - 5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Canvas",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateApp",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt - =",
      "repeats": 2
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "kind": "saveLayout",
      "text": "design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Canvas",
      "identifier": "canvas.export"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "exported",
      "value": "true"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 评审"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "用工作区快捷键一次切换整组应用。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + shift - 2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Review"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Review",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Review",
      "identifier": "review.check"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "checksPassed",
      "value": "3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Review",
      "identifier": "review.comment"
    },
    {
      "kind": "typeText",
      "app": "Review",
      "text": "准备好了，预览也已导出。",
      "ms": 65
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Review",
      "identifier": "review.approve"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "approved",
      "value": "true"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "返回时，窗口的位置和大小会恢复。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + shift - 5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Canvas",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "assertLayout",
      "text": "design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 借用"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "用借用功能，把另一个工作区显示在当前工作区旁边。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + cmd - n"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Notes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Notes",
      "identifier": "notes.task.1"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Notes",
      "identifier": "notes.newTask"
    },
    {
      "kind": "typeText",
      "app": "Notes",
      "text": "准备发布公告。",
      "ms": 65
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectStory",
      "field": "lastTask",
      "value": "准备发布公告。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + cmd - /"
    },
    {
      "kind": "assertLayout",
      "text": "design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 置顶"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "设为始终置顶的窗口会一直显示在其他应用上方。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "launch",
      "apps": [
        "Monitor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Monitor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Monitor",
      "identifier": "monitor.mode"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dragWindow",
      "app": "Monitor",
      "target": "Docs",
      "x": 0.3,
      "y": 0.7
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "kind": "activateApp",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt - return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt - return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 自动化"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "用 CLI 将多项工作区操作组合成脚本。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + shift - 4"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWorkspace",
      "workspace": "Build"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Terminal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "app": "Terminal",
      "identifier": "terminal.command"
    },
    {
      "kind": "typeText",
      "app": "Terminal",
      "text": "focus-session",
      "ms": 65
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "return"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectCommand",
      "text": "focus-session",
      "code": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Canvas",
        "Docs",
        "Notes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectHook",
      "field": "workspace",
      "value": "Design"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "kind": "key",
      "chord": "ctrl + alt + cmd - /"
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "Tatami / 适应环境"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "连接显示器后，自动切换到符合条件的配置方案。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "saveWindow",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "saveWindow",
      "app": "Docs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "virtualDisplay",
      "connected": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitProfile",
      "profile": "Desk",
      "timeoutMs": 12000
    },
    {
      "kind": "expectHook",
      "field": "profile",
      "value": "Desk"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 2200
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "断开显示器后，恢复笔记本的配置方案和布局。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "virtualDisplay",
      "connected": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitProfile",
      "profile": "Laptop",
      "timeoutMs": 12000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitWindows",
      "apps": [
        "Canvas",
        "Docs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "assertWindow",
      "app": "Canvas"
    },
    {
      "kind": "assertWindow",
      "app": "Docs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "text": "TATAMI"
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "text": "工具和工作位置，都为你保留。 | 支持 BSP 窗口平铺的 macOS 工作区管理器。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "ms": 2600
    }
  ],
  "openingApps": [
    "Canvas",
    "Docs"
  ]
}
